        <fullName>TR1__Unwanted_suggestion_types__c</fullName>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <inlineHelpText>The field is designed to identify unwanted types of suggestions. Type values must be written through the separator &quot;;&quot; without spaces and lowercase.
Example: to remove the City and Skill types from the suggestions, enter &quot;city;skill&quot;.
For more information about suggestion types, contact the Textkernel administrator</inlineHelpText>
